# The Tax Calculation Schedule and its Tables A to E fill pages 19 to 23. The
# rules hold Tables A, C, D and E as figures, row for row; Table B is the rate
# schedule of Conn. Gen. Stat. § 12-700(a), which they hold from the statute.

